he most common heavy \'Mechs in the Inner Sphere. Recognizable by its ubiquity and the collars surrounding the missile weapons in its forearms, the Crusader is a versatile design that\'s well suited to a variety of combat roles. The Star League Defense Force took advantage of the \'Mech\'s versatility and it became a frequent workhorse in their regiments. Although the fall of the League saw the loss of the advanced technology used in older models, many Crusaders were retrofitted and remain on the battlefield to this day."),SelectedWeaponHardPoints=("Torso_Left_MH1_streaksrm2","Torso_Right_MH1_streaksrm2","Forearm_Right_EH1_mediumpulselaser","Forearm_Right_MH1_lrm15","Forearm_Left_EH1_mediumpulselaser","Forearm_Left_MH1_lrm15","Arm_Left_Hand_Actuator_Melee","Arm_Right_Hand_Actuator_Melee"),BlankWeaponHardPoints=("Clavicle_Right_GB1_blank","Clavicle_Left_GB1_blank"),bRecalculateFreeSlotsOnSave=True,EquipmentAllocation=(ArmorDataAssetId=(Id="MWArmorDataAsset:StandardArmor"),StructureDataAssetId=(Id="MWStructureDataAsset:StandardStructure"),AllowedHeatSinkType=(TagName="Equipment.HeatSinks.Single"),SlotData=((SlotTypeDataAssetId=(Id="MWSlotTypeDataAsset:General_SlotType"),SlotCounts=((Head, 1),(CenterTorso, 2),(LeftTorso, 11),(LeftArm, 4),(LeftLeg, 2),(RightTorso, 11),(RightArm, 4),(RightLeg, 2)))),InternalEquipment=(LifeSupport,Sensors,Cockpit,Gyro,LeftArm_Shoulder,LeftArm_UpperActuator,RightArm_Shoulder,RightArm_UpperActuator,LeftLeg_Hip,LeftLeg_UpperActuator,LeftLeg_LowerActuator,LeftLeg_FootActuator,RightLeg_Hip,RightLeg_UpperActuator,RightLeg_LowerActuator,RightLeg_FootActuator),OtherCompatibilities=(KelMechEquipmentCompatibilityFunction_TechBase'"KelMechEquipmentCompatibilityFunction_TechBase_1"'),TotalTraitSlots=7),RefitCosts=(Id="MWMechRefitCostsDataAsset:CRD_260_Std_RefitCosts"),EngineRating=260,BaseChassisCost=4324924,SalvageShareCost=34)
